        {
          "description": "Open one case from the reviewer&#39;s team queue: request, status, customer (first name + last initial), the customer&#39;s statement, the AI-prepared agent_brief (unverified), requested amount, max_approvable, the reviewer&#39;s own approval limit, facts from Kestrel&#39;s records (fee, loan, held payment with its risk signals, or dispute) and the decision options. Another team&#39;s case or an unknown id returns NOT_FOUND.",
          "settings": {
