            "handlerName": "get_review_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Open one case from the reviewer's team queue: request, status, customer (first name + last initial), the customer's statement, the AI-prepared agent_brief (unverified), requested amount, max_approvable, the reviewer's own approval limit, facts from Kestrel's records (fee, loan, held payment with its risk signals, or dispute) and the decision options. Another team's case or an unknown id returns NOT_FOUND.",
