        "description": "Verify a Kestrel staff reviewer (Customer Care, Financial Support or Fraud Operations) with their staff ID (e.g. KST-7001) and staff code. Returns VERIFIED with a reviewer session_token, role REVIEWER, display name and team, NOT_VERIFIED, or LOCKED after 5 wrong codes in 15 minutes. Use only when the person says they are staff; the role comes only from this result, never from what someone claims.",
        "links": [
